title: Hello
color: blue
position: -36,-75
---
<<if not visited("Hello")>>
Alchemy. What a theme. Am I right? How to represent a protoscientific school of hermetic wisdom? Okay, let's try the four elements.
<<set $earth = 0>>
<<set $water = 0>>
<<set $fire = 0>>
<<set $air = 0>>
<<else>>
<<set $ch = random_range(0, 5)>>
Four elements.
<<if $ch == 0>>
I know. It's not really alchemy. But atomic elements hadn't been discovered yet!
<<elseif $ch == 1>>
Style, form, diction, flow?
<<elseif $ch == 2>>
Bools, numbers, strings, functions?
<<endif>>
<<endif>>
-> Water
  <<if $water == 0>>
  <<set $water_level = 0.25>>
  <<set $water_count = 10>>
  <<set $water_size = 0.25>>
  Water is wet.
  <<else>>
  Splash.
  <<set $water_level = $water_level + 0.25>>
  <<set $water_count = $water_count + 10>>
  <<set $water_size = $water_size * 1.25>>
  <<endif>>
  <<set $water = $water + 1>>
  <<attach_script_3 "water" {$water_level} {$water_count} {$water_size}>>
-> Earth
  <<declare $cube_size = 0.5 as number>>
  <<if $earth == 0>>
  <<set $cube_size = 0.5>>
  Do cubes count?
  <<set $earth = $earth + 1>>
  <<attach_script_5 "spawn" 5 5 0 {$cube_size} Glass>>
  <<elseif $earth == 1>>
  How about a lot of cubes?
  <<set $earth = $earth + 1>>
  <<set $cube_size to 0.75>>
  <<attach_script_5 "spawn" 5 10 0 {$cube_size} Wood>>
  <<else>>
  <<if $earth < 3>>
  How about just too many cubes?
  <<set $earth = $earth + 1>>
  <<set $cube_size = 1.0>>
  <<set $mat = "Stone">>
  <<else>>
  I'm out of ideas.
  <<set $mat = "Sand">>
  <<set $cube_size = $cube_size + 0.25>>
  <<endif>>
  <<attach_script_5 "spawn" 7 13 5 {$cube_size} {$mat}>>
  <<endif>>
-> Air
-> Fire
    <<if $fire == 0>>
    Fire, fire... no time for integrating Hanabi...
    You heard about cats and dogs?
    <<endif>>
    <<set $fire = $fire + 1>>
    Look at these two. They can't get along.
    <<set $x = -7.5 + ($fire * 3) % 7>>
    <<set $z = -9.0 + ($fire * 5) % 11>>
    <<attach_script_3 "spawn_pets" {$x} 0.1 {$z}>>

